{title: Line of Shema}
{subtitle: 1 Chronicles 2:44; 2:42–45}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 77}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Bb] | [Gm7] |
| [Eb] | [Bb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
In the land where Caleb walked
The sons of [Eb]Jerahmeel’s [Bb]kin
Me[Gm]sha the [Eb]firstborn [Fsus4]stood
Father [Bb]of Ziph the old hill
Hebron’s [Eb]sons came [Gm]forth
[Eb]Korah [F]and Tappuah [Bb]there
Rekem and [Eb]Shema
Roots in the [Gm]southern ground
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
From the branch [Eb]of Shema
A [F]name is clearly known
Ra[Eb]ham was his son
[F]Part of Judah’s [Bb]line
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Shema [F]fathered Ra[Eb]ham
Raham was [Gm]father of [F]Jor[Eb]keam
The bloodline flows [Gm]on
In the [F]promised [Bb]land
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Rekem fathered Shammai
Sham[Eb]mai had a [Bb]son
Maon [Gm]was his [Eb]name
[F]Father of Beth Zur
The [Eb]towns they founded
Mark the [Gm]history
Of this [Eb]tribe in Judah
[F]Settled in the earth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Bb]Shema [F]fathered Ra[Eb]ham
Raham was [Gm]father of [F]Jor[Eb]keam
The bloodline flows [Gm]on
In the [F]promised [Bb]land
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
From [Eb]Hebron to the hills
The names [Bb]are recorded here
A [Eb]branch of Caleb’s house
Kept [F]in the book of years
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Raham and [Bb]Jorkeam
[Eb]Line of Shema [Bb]stands
{end_of_verse}
